# No automatic graphify (Cursor)

This rule applies in **Cursor only**. It **supersedes** any graphify guidance from `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, or skills when running inside Cursor.

Do **not**:

- Run `graphify`, `graphify update`, `graphify query`, `graphify path`, `graphify explain`, or related graphify CLI
- Read or rely on `graphify-out/` for codebase exploration
- Invoke the graphify skill

Use Grep, Read, Glob, and Task explore instead.

Only use graphify when the user explicitly asks for it (e.g. `/graphify` or "run graphify").
